WEBVTT

00:12:27.454 --> 00:12:33.496
And he then found that the most successful
people in terms of getting to

00:12:33.496 --> 00:12:38.121
a sense of a new beginning after a major
ending in their relationship

00:12:38.121 --> 00:12:42.454
or their career or their studies or
their family or whatever, it was,

00:12:43.246 --> 00:12:47.621
the people who did the best at getting to
a sense of a fulfilling and satisfying

00:12:47.621 --> 00:12:52.704
and meaningful new beginning were not
the ones who move quickly from

00:12:53.037 --> 00:12:56.162
the end point to their next point.

00:12:56.912 --> 00:13:00.537
But rather were the ones
who allowed themselves